{"synopsis":"Setelah mengalahkan Komandan Seventh Corps dari Pasukan Demon King Tiny sudah berada di ambang kematian\nNamun dalam situasi mencekam dimana kehancuran umat manusia tidak dapat terhindarkan\nteman terakhirnya yang masih hidup Sword Emperor menggunakan kekuatan barang peninggalan kuno untuk mengirim Tiny kembali ke masa lalu\nTiny yang kembali dari Knight terkuat di dunia menjadi anak yatim piatu di kawasan kumuh mendapatkan kekuatan baru yang tidak dia miliki di kehidupannya dulu\nBisakah Tiny menyelamatkan umat manusia dari kehancuran di kehidupan kali ini","alternative_title":"더 해머","author":"Painkiller","artist":"Mensu","chapters":[{"chapter_id":"8859750a-b82d-4c51-96c9-7375aef4d6f1","number":"96","chapter":"96","title":"Chapter 96","date":"2024-12-02","released":"2024-12-02","images":[]},{"chapter_id":"7480efcf-d82a-4f97-bba8-9d01707ebf4b","number":"95","chapter":"95","title":"Chapter 95","date":"2024-12-02","released":"2024-12-02","images":[]},{"chapter_id":"97501b8f-d949-4459-b236-062b4fd3400a","number":"94","chapter":"94","title":"Chapter 94","date":"2024-12-02","released":"2024-12-02","images":[]},{"chapter_id":"6d4eafe8-7273-4a3c-a252-99eb4d2edb8f","number":"93","chapter":"93","title":"Chapter 93","date":"2024-12-02","released":"2024-12-02","images":[]},{"chapter_id":"7a6b5077-d5e7-45a9-9e7b-36e9cca747ad","number":"92","chapter":"92","title":"Chapter 92","date":"2024-12-02","released":"2024-12-02","images":[]},{"chapter_id":"2a3f6051-84f6-423a-b3c8-acb2488464b5","number":"91","chapter":"91","title":"Chapter 91","date":"2024-11-26","released":"2024-11-26","images":[]},{"chapter_id":"43210b9e-4416-4c11-abb8-6c37c9e43568","number":"90","chapter":"90","title":"Chapter 90","date":"2024-12-02","released":"2024-12-02","images":[]},{"chapter_id":"6ce93453-cc1d-4242-8a0c-0481a1d2252c","number":"89","chapter":"89","title":"Chapter 89","date":"2024-12-02","released":"2024-12-02","images":[]},{"chapter_id":"232adcfc-cfae-433c-a80f-4248d6d8f96f","number":"8